00:33:27.360 --> 00:33:32.240 line:95% align:center position:50%
to have everything saved
on GitHub on my private repo.

00:33:32.520 --> 00:33:37.120 line:95% align:center position:50%
Okay, so here you see,
this is in accelerated mode, the loop

00:33:37.640 --> 00:33:41.240 line:95% align:center position:50%
that I used also to create
chapter by chapter my story.

00:33:41.360 --> 00:33:44.880 line:95% align:center position:50%
But my story is already created
in my mind, it's to implement it.

00:33:45.280 --> 00:33:47.280 line:95% align:center position:50%
So maybe it's time now for the epilogue.

00:33:47.320 --> 00:33:48.720 line:95% align:center position:50%
We have like 6 minutes left.

00:33:50.120 --> 00:33:51.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
What did I learn by doing that?

00:33:52.720 --> 00:33:57.200 line:95% align:center position:50%
Well, I learned that we can transpose
things from AI SDLC to other topics.

00:33:58.280 --> 00:34:03.000 line:95% align:center position:50%
And I mean, LLM,
there is language in LLM, right?

00:34:03.080 --> 00:34:04.880 line:95% align:center position:50%
So basically they're made to write text.

00:34:04.920 --> 00:34:07.720 line:95% align:center position:50%
So it looks fair to try and do something.

00:34:07.840 --> 00:34:11.000 line:95% align:center position:50%
But what I know here is AI
is not replacing me here.

00:34:11.560 --> 00:34:13.640 line:95% align:center position:50%
I'm still the designer.
I'm the architect.

00:34:13.720 --> 00:34:17.400 line:95% align:center position:50%
I'm used to design systems and delegate
the implementation of the system to others

00:34:17.920 --> 00:34:20.200 line:95% align:center position:50%
because I design big,
big, big systems, right?

00:34:20.520 --> 00:34:22.640 line:95% align:center position:50%
I can't implement the big,
big, big system, right?

00:34:23.080 --> 00:34:27.400 line:95% align:center position:50%
So I'm used to that.
So that was my delegation postulate.

00:34:28.120 --> 00:34:32.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
But what I designed is both the law
but the loops, because that was

00:34:32.840 --> 00:34:34.960 line:95% align:center position:50%
the talk from Guillaume this morning.

00:34:35.040 --> 00:34:36.880 line:95% align:center position:50%
I don't know if you attended this one.

00:34:37.600 --> 00:34:41.280 line:95% align:center position:50%
Loop engineering, how you design the loop,
how you design the harness,

00:34:41.360 --> 00:34:47.400 line:95% align:center position:50%
how do you design the rules to have
now the delegation in place and the agent

00:34:47.680 --> 00:34:51.600 line:95% align:center position:50%
working for you the way you want to To do
it, so here by doing that I am

00:34:51.760 --> 00:34:53.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
both the artist and the architect.

00:34:53.640 --> 00:34:55.140 line:95% align:center position:50%
So I'm very happy, right?

00:34:57.160 --> 00:35:00.440 line:95% align:center position:50%
Then when you're like that and when you're
a guy like me,

00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:04.920 line:95% align:center position:50%
you don't know me, but believe you me,
imagination is not a problem with me.

00:35:05.440 --> 00:35:10.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
And with that kind of system,
your limit is only your imagination.

00:35:10.760 --> 00:35:12.800 line:95% align:center position:50%
So it means that I'm becoming unlimited.

00:35:13.280 --> 00:35:15.160 line:95% align:center position:50%
I can have so many ideas.
I mean, absolutely.

00:35:15.680 --> 00:35:18.960 line:95% align:center position:50%
Crazy worlds that I created,
crazy story, crazy project I want to do.

00:35:20.160 --> 00:35:23.600 line:95% align:center position:50%
Maybe next year I'll come back to you
and say, let's write a book all

00:35:23.640 --> 00:35:25.240 line:95% align:center position:50%
together with your smartphone.

00:35:25.480 --> 00:35:27.700 line:95% align:center position:50%
You know, crazy stuff
we can imagine, right?

00:35:28.080 --> 00:35:33.480 line:95% align:center position:50%
So no more limitation except,
of course, token price, everything.

00:35:34.240 --> 00:35:35.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
But that's not the real limit.

00:35:35.840 --> 00:35:38.080 line:95% align:center position:50%
The real limit is this one: my wife.

00:35:39.040 --> 00:35:41.840 line:95% align:center position:50%
She said, I'm so fed up of you.

00:35:42.280 --> 00:35:44.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
Playing with your mistress, you know.

00:35:44.960 --> 00:35:46.000 line:95% align:center position:50%
AI is your new mistress.

00:35:46.080 --> 00:35:48.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
You're spending all of your time— when you
work, you're on AI,

00:35:48.600 --> 00:35:50.440 line:95% align:center position:50%
when you're not working,
you're on your book,

00:35:50.760 --> 00:35:53.800 line:95% align:center position:50%
or you're trying to make a comic,
or you're trying to do other things.

00:35:54.160 --> 00:35:55.080 line:95% align:center position:50%
I'm fed up about that.

00:35:55.200 --> 00:35:58.400 line:95% align:center position:50%
And she doesn't know that there is
not one AI, it's AIs.

00:35:58.760 --> 00:36:01.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
So I have many mistresses,
but don't tell her that, right?

00:36:02.000 --> 00:36:05.400 line:95% align:center position:50%
So we have limitations
because we are humans.

00:36:05.440 --> 00:36:09.840 line:95% align:center position:50%
So as a conclusion, what I say is we
have to make sure that we stay grounded.

00:36:09.920 --> 00:36:12.440 line:95% align:center position:50%
That's the yoga teacher now speaking here.
And human.

00:36:13.040 --> 00:36:17.120 line:95% align:center position:50%
Because I mean, we can go too far,
we can go so fast that we forgot

00:36:17.520 --> 00:36:19.800 line:95% align:center position:50%
why we were doing the things
in the first place, right?

00:36:19.840 --> 00:36:22.840 line:95% align:center position:50%
That's why I had to change between
my different projects and stuff.

00:36:22.880 --> 00:36:27.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
And the way I managed to deal with my wife
is I just embarked her

00:36:27.400 --> 00:36:30.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
on a new project, okay?

00:36:31.000 --> 00:36:35.040 line:95% align:center position:50%
Because she's a yoga teacher like me,
so I can't say everything,

00:36:35.080 --> 00:36:39.840 line:95% align:center position:50%
but it's about game yoga,
and there's a bit of AI inside that.

00:36:40.920 --> 00:36:42.880 line:95% align:center position:50%
So now it's okay, she's on board, right?

00:36:43.400 --> 00:36:46.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
So thank you very much for your attention.
I hope it was entertaining.

00:36:48.800 --> 00:36:50.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
Yeah, you learned things.

00:36:50.920 --> 00:36:54.800 line:95% align:center position:50%
You have the 2 QR codes for the book that
is on Amazon and the one that is online.

00:36:56.640 --> 00:36:59.200 line:95% align:center position:50%
I don't know if we have time
for questions, but if not,

00:36:59.320 --> 00:37:01.960 line:95% align:center position:50%
or a few questions, yes,
you can always bump into me.

00:37:02.040 --> 00:37:02.120 line:95% align:center position:50%
Yeah.

00:37:02.160 --> 00:37:03.860 line:95% align:center position:50%
Hi, I'm a student from
the University of Toronto.

00:37:15.320 --> 00:37:17.040 line:95% align:center position:50%
Do you check each chapter to see
if it's accurate to the story?

00:37:17.080 --> 00:37:18.920 line:95% align:center position:50%
That depends.
That depends on my mood.

00:37:19.000 --> 00:37:23.000 line:95% align:center position:50%
But generally what I do is
I go through it and I check that that's

00:37:23.080 --> 00:37:27.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
the idea I got in the beginning
when I designed the scenario, because

00:37:27.400 --> 00:37:29.200 line:95% align:center position:50%
I know what the chapter will be about.

00:37:29.560 --> 00:37:32.920 line:95% align:center position:50%
But then with some of the rules,
you will extend, you will complete,

00:37:34.240 --> 00:37:36.280 line:95% align:center position:50%
enrich the scenario.
So I have to check.

00:37:37.280 --> 00:37:40.920 line:95% align:center position:50%
If I'm not happy with that,
then it might take more time.

00:37:41.200 --> 00:37:45.600 line:95% align:center position:50%
For instance,
the longest time in the 20 minutes that I

00:37:45.640 --> 00:37:47.600 line:95% align:center position:50%
accelerated there is the image creation.

00:37:48.040 --> 00:37:50.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
The text is going very
fast, very, very fast.

00:37:50.600 --> 00:37:52.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
It's the image generation
that takes a lot of time.

00:37:52.880 --> 00:37:55.200 line:95% align:center position:50%
And it took a lot of time
because the image was buggy.

00:37:55.760 --> 00:37:57.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
So I said, oh, you have to fix the image.

00:37:57.920 --> 00:38:00.160 line:95% align:center position:50%
Okay, let me understand.
And that's what took time.

00:38:00.240 --> 00:38:02.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
The text, it's a few minutes.
It's not 20 minutes.

00:38:08.760 --> 00:38:09.800 line:95% align:center position:50%
Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:38:09.840 --> 00:38:12.640 line:95% align:center position:50%
But sometimes I browse through it,
sometimes I just stop and say,

00:38:13.040 --> 00:38:14.360 line:95% align:center position:50%
something wrong here, you know.

00:38:15.480 --> 00:38:16.960 line:95% align:center position:50%
And then yes, there's a discussion.

00:38:17.000 --> 00:38:21.600 line:95% align:center position:50%
That's why I have these discussions, these
different threads in my project in Codex.

00:38:21.640 --> 00:38:26.320 line:95% align:center position:50%
So yeah, it's a collaboration with—
I still review things.

00:38:27.600 --> 00:38:28.340 line:95% align:center position:50%
Yeah, no more?

00:38:31.960 --> 00:38:32.700 line:95% align:center position:50%
Oh, yes.

00:38:32.880 --> 00:38:34.240 line:95% align:center position:50%
Maybe there?
Yes, a question?

00:38:34.720 --> 00:38:35.600 line:95% align:center position:50%
You'll have to shout.

00:38:39.120 --> 00:38:40.280 line:95% align:center position:50%
Yeah, I can't hear you.

00:38:42.040 --> 00:38:44.080 line:95% align:center position:50%
What was the timeline?
Ah, timeline, yeah.

00:38:44.440 --> 00:38:45.640 line:95% align:center position:50%
Oh, that's a tough question.

00:38:45.840 --> 00:38:48.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
Because as I said,
most of the time I spent was before

00:38:48.920 --> 00:38:50.760 line:95% align:center position:50%
when I was designing the lore.

00:38:51.000 --> 00:38:54.920 line:95% align:center position:50%
And it was not something that I sat down
and I say, let's design the lore,

00:38:55.040 --> 00:38:56.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
and I stop when it's finished, right?

00:38:57.120 --> 00:39:01.280 line:95% align:center position:50%
So it took several months for me because
the idea was maturing in my mind.

00:39:01.840 --> 00:39:05.400 line:95% align:center position:50%
And then when the lore is done,
then writing the book is not that long.

00:39:05.520 --> 00:39:08.280 line:95% align:center position:50%
So most of the time, but it's
several months, several months.

00:39:09.120 --> 00:39:11.200 line:95% align:center position:50%
But it depends on what you want to do,
definitely.

00:39:11.320 --> 00:39:13.680 line:95% align:center position:50%
Is it fun?

00:39:13.760 --> 00:39:14.880 line:95% align:center position:50%
Yeah, of course.

00:39:15.000 --> 00:39:19.640 line:95% align:center position:50%
The fun part is you create the characters,
you describe them so well, right?

00:39:20.040 --> 00:39:24.960 line:95% align:center position:50%
And then you see them becoming alive
and starting to talk with each other.

00:39:25.160 --> 00:39:26.020 line:95% align:center position:50%
That's fun.

00:39:26.800 --> 00:39:27.380 line:95% align:center position:50%
Yeah.

00:39:28.880 --> 00:39:29.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
How many tokens?

00:39:29.600 --> 00:39:32.960 line:95% align:center position:50%
Oh no, at the beginning,
at one moment I said I should check that,

00:39:33.360 --> 00:39:34.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
you know, really, but it was too late.

00:39:34.600 --> 00:39:36.320 line:95% align:center position:50%
I was already gone, right?

00:39:36.480 --> 00:39:38.000 line:95% align:center position:50%
But I definitely want it.

00:39:38.240 --> 00:39:43.080 line:95% align:center position:50%
So that's something that I will do in my
new adventures, is in the writing protocol

00:39:43.120 --> 00:39:48.240 line:95% align:center position:50%
to log everything and make some graphs
and, you know, things that we architects

00:39:48.280 --> 00:39:49.920 line:95% align:center position:50%
and IT people would like to have, right?

00:39:49.960 --> 00:39:53.640 line:95% align:center position:50%
Right, so that I will do certainly
in the future, but I didn't this time.

00:39:57.320 --> 00:39:57.560 line:95% align:center position:50%
Fine.

00:39:59.520 --> 00:40:00.600 line:95% align:center position:50%
Okay, thank you very much.

